# Local Uploads (Keep the folder structure but maybe not all big csvs? User provided CSVs... 
# usually we don't commit big data CSVs. I'll ignore CSVs in uploads/ but keep JSON?)
# Actually, for this "CRM setup", the user might want the CSVs. I'll leave them in unless >100MB.
# User's my_emils.csv was 52MB. GitHub limit is 100MB. It's safe-ish, but bad practice.
# I'll ignore .csv in uploaded folders to be safe and clean.
tau-backend/uploads/*.csv
tau-backend/uploads/*.json
!tau-backend/uploads/.keep
